# ============================================================
# The Daily Pulse — production environment (COMMITTED to git)
# ============================================================
# Vite loads this file automatically for `npm run build`
# (production mode), so production builds ALWAYS get the
# NewsAPI key even if the local, gitignored `.env` is absent
# or not pushed.
#
# NOTE: the NewsAPI *free* plan only allows requests from
# localhost. On a public domain the app detects the rejection
# and automatically falls back to the free BBC/Guardian RSS
# feeds, so the site stays live either way. For guaranteed
# NewsAPI delivery on production, use a paid plan's key here.
#
# This key is visible to any browser that runs the app (it is
# a client-side app — there is no server to keep it secret),
# so treat it accordingly.
VITE_NEWSAPI_KEY=afc995bdfc3243cc8453d47b275548af